    "equivalence_note": "the controller factory's 37 and the arch controller's 8 in-tree Sourcify sources have identical blobs at these five commits; the licence-header commit 6164ddd4 changes every file's comment bytes and the sentinel's Sourcify sources match from there to the head 488b30d0 (bytecode is unaffected because bytecodeHash is none). The deployer's exact checkout among the five cannot be determined: the factory deployed at block 18687391 (2023-11-30T22:27:35Z, corrected 2026-09-19 from an earlier miscomputed 2023-12-04T08:53:59Z; re-verified against publicnode, mevblocker and Blockscout), about an hour after 6164ddd4 and its main-merge d46ecb80, and main's only intervening commits (6164ddd4, d46ecb80) carry the post-rewrite blobs the deployed bytecode does not match, so the deployer used a checkout that was not main's tip at deploy time and none of the five can be distinguished from on-chain evidence; see docs/kickoff/1359/evidence/source-match-1748.json equivalent_commits_deployer_checkout",
